' v1.2's interaction mode is the location scene's (`preset classic|extended ai
' none seed 3 start 30`, Paradise Camp). In fight mode a door is not entered
' (`OnClickEntrance`): the click walks there and nothing opens. Back in speak
' mode the same door opens. Fight mode, then INFO opened and closed: speak
' mode again (`OnActivateScene`). Fight mode, a save and a load: speak mode.
' The legacy game keeps v0.9.1's `Player.FightMode` through all of these.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
fight
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent: not entered in fight mode
wait 200
fight                    ' speak
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent: entered
wait 200
esc
wait 10
fight
menu 300,150
menuline 1               ' INFO (v1.2's menu: FIGHT first)
wait 3
sceneclick 20,185        ' back: speak mode again
wait 5
fight
save
wait 5
load                     ' speak mode again
wait 10
quit
